            "key": "log.ines_1",
            "text": "Core sample 41: grey dust, grey dust, one blue pebble. Logged it as \"anomalous\". Kept it as \"mine\". — Ines"
        },
        {
            "key": "log.theo_1",
            "text": "Named every seedling in tray four; the mint is Gerald. Gerald is the best mint on the Moon, which is a low bar, but he's clearing it. — Theo"
        },
        {
            "key": "log.ro_2",
            "text": "Read the storm warning on air tonight, tucked between two slow songs so it wouldn't sound so scary. 07 rolled right up to the speaker and stayed there. — Ro"
        },
        {
            "key": "log.ines_2",
            "text": "My call as mission lead: all four of us leave on the morning shuttle. It's the right call, and I've never hated being right so much. — Ines"
        },
        {
            "key": "log.kenji_2",
            "text": "Hid a spare wheel for 07 under the tarp in the crawler. Next time I'll give it six matching ones, not just patch the odd one out. — Kenji"
        },
        {
            "key": "log.theo_2",
            "text": "Ten minutes to pack. I left Moss the watering schedule, and Moss hummed at me as if I'd insulted the tomatoes. — Theo"
        },
        {
            "key": "log.ro_3",
            "text": "Last show before the shuttle. I left the radio on for you, 07. Keep it playing, and we'll find you by the music. — Ro"
        },
        {
            "key": "log.ines_3",
            "text": "We were coming back, 07. I need you to know we tried. — Ines"
        },
        {
            "key": "log.theo_3",
            "text": "Left the last tray by the window. If anything grows, tell me. — Theo"
        },
        {
            "key": "log.kenji_3",
            "text": "They asked me what to do with the rover, and I said leave it switched on. Don't let anyone retire you, 07. — Kenji"
        },
        {
            "key": "ticker.radio.weather",
            "text": "…weather tonight: clear skies over the Sea of Tranquility, as always…"
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.mast_1",
            "text": "17 MAR 2047 · Lumen Station, this is Houston relay. All four crew landed safely. Program review postponed. Stand by."
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.mast_2",
            "text": "2 APR 2047 · Lumen Station, this is Houston relay. A return window is under study. Keep station systems on standby."
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.mast_3",
            "text": "11 MAY 2047 · Lumen Station, this is Houston relay. Return window cancelled. Program review continues."
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.mast_4",
            "text": "29 SEP 2047 · Lumen Station, this is Houston relay. Program closed. This channel will no longer be monitored. Thank you, Lumen."
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.mast_5",
            "text": "07, it's Ro. They say nobody's listening up there. I'm sending this anyway. — Ro, 9 Jun 2048"
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.mast_6",
            "text": "Ines took a desk job. She still walks round the block every morning to check Earth is still there. — Ro, 14 Jul 2049"
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.mast_7",
            "text": "Theo says the basil on my windowsill isn't as good as yours was. Don't tell him I agree. — Ro, 2 Aug 2051"
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.mast_8",
            "text": "Kenji fixed my kettle with a paperclip and a long speech about tolerances. He says hello to the duck. — Ro, 30 Oct 2054"
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.mast_9",
            "text": "If that old dish ever wakes up, I'll be listening on the station's frequency. You know how to find me: three short, one long. — Ro, 2 Jun 2059"
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.mast_10",
            "text": "It's been twenty years. I still play the long-drive tape on Sundays. — Ro, 13 Mar 2067"
        },
        {
            "key": "ticker.ending.answer",
            "text": "I heard you, 07. I'm still here. — Ro"
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.after_1",
            "text": "Told the others. Theo cried, then blamed hay fever. — Ro"
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.after_2",
            "text": "Ines went out at midnight to look at the Moon. She says it's still there. — Ro"
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.after_3",
            "text": "Kenji asked if you still have the odd wheel. I told him all six match now, and he had to sit down. — Ro"
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.after_4",
            "text": "Played your song on my show tonight. Audience: two neighbours and a very old cat. Best audience since you. — Ro"
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.after_5",
            "text": "I told Theo about the dome. He's been unbearable all week. — Ro"
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.after_6",
            "text": "Weather tonight: rain over Lagos. It's always clear where you are, isn't it? — Ro"
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.after_7",
            "text": "Ines's daughter wants to be an astronaut. Ines is pretending to be worried. — Ro"
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.after_8",
            "text": "The four of us wrote to the agency together. Don't hold your breath; you don't breathe anyway. — Ro"
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.after_9",
            "text": "Kenji's grandson won a rubber duck at the fair. Kenji says it's a sign. — Ro"
        },
        {
            "key": "letter.after_10",
            "text": "Goodnight, 07. Keep the radio on. We'll keep ours on too. — Ro"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.sheet.title",
            "text": "Lumen basin, surveyed on foot. — I. Kalani"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.tally.label",
            "text": "Checked:"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.complete.note",
            "text": "Checked: the Moon is still there. — I."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.state.heart_waiting",
            "text": "Something still waits in its heart."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.state.picked_clean",
            "text": "Picked clean."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.state.mast_dark",
            "text": "Dark. Waiting to be lit."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.state.mast_lit",
            "text": "Lit. Home reaches this far."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.place.lander.name",
            "text": "The Lander"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.place.lander.note",
            "text": "Home. Population: four, one rover, one very proud basil."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.site.depot.name",
            "text": "Supply Depot"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.site.depot.note",
            "text": "Spare everything. Mostly bolts."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.site.kestrel.name",
            "text": "Kestrel-3"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.site.kestrel.note",
            "text": "Poor thing. It came down still pointing at Earth."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.trail.kestrel.name",
            "text": "Kestrel's skid"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.trail.kestrel.note",
            "text": "I paced it. Twice."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.site.drill.name",
            "text": "Drill Rig"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.site.drill.note",
            "text": "My drill. Core 41 came from here, the blue one."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.site.garage.name",
            "text": "Kenji's Garage"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.site.garage.note",
            "text": "No entry without Kenji. Kenji: no entry without a helmet."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.site.lander.name",
            "text": "Canyon Supply Lander"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.site.lander.note",
            "text": "Brought Theo's seed trays. Landed… firmly."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.friend.tilly.name",
            "text": "Tilly's crater"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.friend.tilly.note",
            "text": "Where she sulks when I walk too fast."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.relay.0.name",
            "text": "Mound relay"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.relay.0.note",
            "text": "Ro calls it the little one."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.relay.1.name",
            "text": "Rim shoulder relay"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.relay.1.note",
            "text": "Longest shadows in the basin."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.relay.2.name",
            "text": "Canyon mouth relay"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.relay.2.note",
            "text": "Everything echoes here. Even the static."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.relay.3.name",
            "text": "Terminus relay"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.relay.3.note",
            "text": "Right above Ro's chamber. Of course."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.canyon.mouth.name",
            "text": "Whispering Canyon"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.canyon.mouth.note",
            "text": "Say something. It says it back, quieter."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.canyon.lip.name",
            "text": "The chasm"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.canyon.lip.note",
            "text": "Too wide to cross. Kenji says \"for now\"."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.canyon.landing.name",
            "text": "The far side"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.canyon.landing.note",
            "text": "Someone always leaves a light on over here."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.canyon.ledge.name",
            "text": "Ro's ledge"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.canyon.ledge.note",
            "text": "She comes here to hear herself sing back."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.canyon.terminus.name",
            "text": "Ro's chamber"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.canyon.terminus.note",
            "text": "Best acoustics on the Moon. Her words, not mine."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.canyon.exit.name",
            "text": "The way out"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.canyon.exit.note",
            "text": "One way only. Don't try it upwards."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.region.peak.name",
            "text": "The Peak"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.region.peak.note",
            "text": "The dish. Kenji's job, after the storm."
        },
        {
            "key": "map.region.terraces.name",
            "text": "The terraces"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.region.terraces.note",
            "text": "Too steep for wheels. Atlas parked up here?"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.place.antenna_farm.name",
            "text": "Ro's antennas"
        },
        {
            "key": "map.place.antenna_farm.note",
            "text": "They hum in a solar storm. Ro calls it the choir."
        },
